---
title: "Vivacon - C4 Level 2 - Containers (AS_IS)"
---
%% C4 "container" = separately runnable/deployable unit, NOT a Docker container.
%% Logical view only; hosting (Compose, VM, Vercel, tunnel) is in deployment-topology.mmd.
%% Flowchart fallback for C4, see .kiro/steering/c4-model.md.
%% Evidence: docs/architecture/architecture-inventory.md sections 1-3.
flowchart LR
    user["<b>Member / Administrator</b><br/>[Person]<br/>Uses Vivacon in a web browser"]

    subgraph browser_ext["Called from the browser"]
        direction TB
        sight["<b>SightEngine</b><br/>[External System, third-party SaaS]<br/>Image moderation"]
        gmaps["<b>Google Maps JS API</b><br/>[External System, Google]<br/>Login-location map"]
    end

    subgraph vivacon["Vivacon [Software System]"]
        direction LR
        spa["<b>Single-page app</b><br/>[Container: React 17, CRA, MUI 5]<br/>Routes, pages, Context state;<br/>axios client + SockJS/STOMP client<br/><i>runs in the browser</i>"]
        web["<b>Web server</b><br/>[Container: nginx 1.27]<br/>Serves the bundle, SPA fallback,<br/>reverse proxy for /api/ and /ws/"]
        api["<b>API application</b><br/>[Container: Spring Boot 2.5, Java 11]<br/>REST /api/v1, STOMP broker /ws,<br/>JWT security, business logic,<br/>scheduled recommendations,<br/>GeoLite2 file for IP lookup"]
        db[("<b>Database</b><br/>[Container: PostgreSQL]<br/>19 entity tables + stored functions<br/>for statistics and chat search")]
    end

    subgraph server_ext["Called from the API"]
        direction TB
        cloudinary["<b>Cloudinary</b><br/>[External System, third-party SaaS]<br/>Image storage"]
        msid["<b>Microsoft identity platform</b><br/>[External System, Microsoft]<br/>OAuth2 token endpoint"]
        msgraph["<b>Microsoft Graph</b><br/>[External System, Microsoft]<br/>Email delivery"]
    end

    user -->|"Uses, browser"| spa
    spa -->|"GET bundle, HTTPS"| web
    spa -->|"REST JSON, Bearer JWT<br/>/api/v1/**"| web
    spa <-->|"SockJS + STOMP<br/>WS-Authorization, /ws"| web
    web -->|"HTTP/1.1 proxy<br/>/api/, /ws/ with Upgrade"| api
    api -->|"JDBC: JPA repositories<br/>+ stored procedure calls"| db
    api -->|"Upload image, HTTPS SDK"| cloudinary
    api -->|"Token request, HTTPS<br/>(async handler)"| msid
    api -->|"sendMail, HTTPS<br/>(async handler)"| msgraph
    spa -->|"GET check.json, HTTPS"| sight
    spa -->|"Maps JS loader, HTTPS"| gmaps

    classDef person fill:#E0F2FE,stroke:#0284C7,stroke-width:2px,color:#0F172A
    classDef client fill:#E0F2FE,stroke:#0284C7,stroke-width:2px,color:#0F172A
    classDef service fill:#DBEAFE,stroke:#2563EB,stroke-width:2px,color:#0F172A
    classDef integration fill:#FFEDD5,stroke:#EA580C,stroke-width:2px,color:#0F172A
    classDef storage fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#16A34A,stroke-width:2px,color:#0F172A
    classDef external fill:#F1F5F9,stroke:#64748B,stroke-width:2px,color:#0F172A
    classDef processing fill:#F3E8FF,stroke:#9333EA,stroke-width:2px,color:#0F172A
    class user person
    class spa client
    class web integration
    class api service
    class db storage
    class cloudinary,msid,msgraph,gmaps external
    class sight processing
    style vivacon fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#2563EB,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#1E3A8A
    style browser_ext fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#CBD5E1,color:#334155
    style server_ext fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#CBD5E1,color:#334155
